5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to be extremely careful with the budget this year. I want to ensure we have a precise understanding of all costs before we announce anything to the members.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Budget is important, but we should also consider the administrative burden. We can't let the organizers be overwhelmed by the preparation and on-site duties.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree on the budget, but we must prioritize member cohesion. The year-groups are too divided. We need a destination that encourages interaction and shared living.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe the quality of rest is often overlooked. If the members cannot sleep well, the training quality suffers. We should investigate the actual living conditions.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must address the financial risks. A flat fee is risky if people cancel last minute or spend unevenly. We need to know how the costs are actually distributed.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, administrative ease is fine, but not at the cost of a deficit. I suggest we look into the actual receipts and quoting terms to avoid surprises.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I'm not suggesting we ignore the budget, Ryuji. I'm suggesting we avoid a situation where the organizers are too exhausted to actually train.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, rest is important, but isolation is a bigger problem. I want to see how previous camps handled the social dynamics and the mixing of year-groups.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, I understand, but a tired mind is not an open one. I'd like to know more about the bed arrangements and the actual attendance patterns.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, I agree on the receipts. However, we also need to look at the quoting terms for whole-building lets to see if we can mitigate the risk of individual cancellations.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,Let's divide the research. I will focus on the financial history and the quoting terms to ensure we don't repeat past mistakes with the club account.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the booking process and the cooking duties. We need to know exactly how much time is lost to administration and on-site labor.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will investigate the seniors' views on year-group mixing and the attendance sheets. I want to see who actually shows up and why they stay apart.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the prefecture rate sheets for beds and the accounts from clubs that went inland. I want to compare the quality of the sleeping facilities.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets. I want to see the hidden costs and the flexibility of the contracts.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,That seems like a comprehensive plan. Let's proceed with these investigations so we can make a rational decision based on data.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. I'll focus on the workload.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I hope we can find a way to bring the members closer together this time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I look forward to seeing if we can find a place that allows everyone to truly recover each night.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the financial stability and the fairness of the cost distribution.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
